5148\u7ec8\u6b62\u6b8b\u7559\u8fdb\u7a0b\u518d\u5220\u9664\uff1a\n\n```powershell\n# \u5f3a\u5236\u7ec8\u6b62\u6240\u6709 git \u53ca hermes \u76f8\u5173\u8fdb\u7a0b\u6811\ntaskkill /F /IM git.exe /T\ntaskkill /F /IM git-remote-https.exe /T\ntaskkill /F /IM hermes-agent.exe /T\n\n# \u5220\u9664\u65e7\u5b89\u88c5\u76ee\u5f55\nRemove-Item -Recurse -Force \" $ env:LOCALAPPDATA\\hermes\\hermes-agent\"\n```\n\n#### 2. \u6e05\u9664\u9519\u8bef\u7684\u4ee3\u7406\u914d\u7f6e\uff08\u5982\u679c\u4e4b\u524d\u8bbe\u7f6e\u8fc7\uff09\n\n```powershell\ngit config --global --unset http.proxy\ngit config --global --unset https.proxy\n```\n\n#### 3. \u4f7f\u7528\u955c\u50cf\u624b\u52a8\u6d45\u514b\u9686\uff08\u63a8\u8350\uff09\n\n\u7531\u4e8e Setup \u811a\u672c\u5185\u90e8\u786c\u7f16\u7801\u4e86 GitHub \u539f\u59cb\u5730\u5740\uff0c\u65e0\u6cd5\u81ea\u52a8\u8d70\u955c\u50cf\u3002\u6700\u7a33\u59a5\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u662f\u624b\u52a8\u7528\u955c\u50cf\u5b8c\u6210\u514b\u9686\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u8ba9 Setup \u8df3\u8fc7\u7f51\u7edc\u6b65\u9aa4\u76f4\u63a5\u8fdb\u5165\u6784\u5efa\uff1a\n\n```powershell\n# \u4f7f\u7528 gh-proxy \u955c\u50cf\u8fdb\u884c\u6d45\u514b\u9686\uff08\u6570\u636e\u91cf\u6781\u5c0f\uff0c\u6210\u529f\u7387\u9ad8\uff09\ngit clone --depth 1 https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent.git \" $ env:LOCALAPPDATA\\hermes\\hermes-agent\"\n```\n\n> **\u26a0\ufe0f \u6ce8\u610f**\uff1a\u90e8\u5206\u955c\u50cf\u7ad9\u5bf9 `git clone` \u7684\u652f\u6301\u4e0d\u7a33\u5b9a\u3002\u5982\u679c\u4e0a\u8ff0\u547d\u4ee4\u62a5\u9519\uff0c\u53ef\u5c1d\u8bd5\u4ee5\u4e0b\u5907\u9009\u955c\u50cf\uff1a\n>\n> -   `https://ghfast.top/https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent.git`\n> -   `https://hub.gitmirror.com/https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent.git`\n> -   `https://gitclone.com/github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent.git`\n\n#### 4. \u9a8c\u8bc1\u5e76\u8fd0\u884c Setup\n\n```powershell\n# \u786e\u8ba4\u514b\u9686\u6210\u529f\uff08\u5e94\u8fd4\u56de True\uff09\nTest-Path \" $ env:LOCALAPPDATA\\hermes\\hermes-agent\\.git\"\n\n# \u91cd\u65b0\u8fd0\u884c Hermes Setup\n# Setup \u68c0\u6d4b\u5230 .git \u76ee\u5f55\u5b58\u5728\uff0c\u901a\u5e38\u4f1a\u8df3\u8fc7\u514b\u9686\u9636\u6bb5\uff0c\u76f4\u63a5\u6267\u884c\u540e\u7eed\u6784\u5efa/\u914d\u7f6e\n`", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4608768672/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4608775955", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/37827#issuecomment-4608775955", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/37827", "id": 4608775955, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABErRXEw", "user": {"login": "wang2766157", "id": 20835556, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIwODM1NTU2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20835556?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/wang2766157", "html_url": "https://github.com/wang2766157", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wang2766157/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wang2766157/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wang2766157/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wang2766157/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wang2766157/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wang2766157/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wang2766157/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wang2766157/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wang2766157/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-03T03:1